WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.973
Lesson six. Pets!

2
00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:11.075
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.046 --> 00:00:13.760
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.712
Today we learn: Pets! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.371 --> 00:00:21.804
Rabbit! Say it with me. Rabbit!

6
00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:29.428
Hamster! Say it with me. Hamster!

7
00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:36.613
Turtle! Say it with me. Turtle!

8
00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.851
Puppy! Say it with me. Puppy!

9
00:00:47.865 --> 00:00:51.315
Kitten! Say it with me. Kitten!

10
00:00:55.313 --> 00:00:58.680
Chick! Say it with me. Chick!

11
00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:06.638
Goldfish! Say it with me. Goldfish!

12
00:01:10.686 --> 00:01:14.220
Parrot! Say it with me. Parrot!

13
00:01:18.229 --> 00:01:24.849
Listen. It has long ears. It has a short tail.

14
00:01:24.899 --> 00:01:30.083
Say it with me. It has long ears. It has a short tail.

15
00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:41.113
The fluffy puppy wags its tail when it is happy. My kitten likes to chase the goldfish bowl.

16
00:01:41.163 --> 00:01:42.465
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.262 --> 00:01:47.684
What's this?

18
00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:49.129
It's a turtle!

19
00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:54.197
What's this?

20
00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.523
It's a chick!

21
00:01:56.463 --> 00:02:05.446
This is K. K is for kite. K is for key. This is L. L is for lion. L is for leaf.

22
00:02:09.456 --> 00:02:16.711
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:18.383
Bye-bye, friends!

